Lucid-Everything is a modified version of WhiteSur-icon-theme.

    Upstream:  WhiteSur-icon-theme
    Author:    vinceliuice
    Source:    https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme
    Licence:   GNU General Public License, version 3 (see COPYING)

Modifications by the LucidOS project:

    - Renamed from "WhiteSur" to "Lucid-Everything", in index.theme and in
      the directory name, so it can sit beneath the Lucid theme in the
      fallback chain without a name collision.
    - index.theme Name, Comment and Inherits adjusted accordingly.

No LucidOS-original artwork is included in this directory. LucidOS's own
icons are in ../Lucid and ../Lucid-Dark and are licensed separately; see
../COPYING.md.

This theme remains under the GPL-3.0, as it must: the licence does not
permit adding restrictions to it, and it is distributed here on its own
terms rather than under the LucidOS artwork licence.
